  "ruleText": "Mvi 208.11 Concluding Proceeding. No party shall be required to rest his case at a given time, except when the board has heard all relevant evidence and rebuttals.\n\nSource. #6980, eff 4-21-99, EXPIRED: 4-21-07\n\nNew. #8978, INTERIM, eff 9-14-07, EXPIRES: 3-12-08; ss by #9043-A, eff 11-29-07",
